{"availability":"available","full":"TPAINN/aurora-player","name":"aurora-player","description":"Music player for the browser: word-level synced lyrics, multi-catalog search, DJ-style transitions. React 19, Vite","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-25T22:26:07Z","updated":"2026-10-12T02:04:09Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aurora-player-seven.vercel.app","topics":["audio-visualizer","dj","framer-motion","karaoke","lyrics","music-player","pwa","react","vite","web-audio","youtube"],"demo":"https://aurora-player-tpainn.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:21.301Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:21.301Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:21.301Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:50:56.836Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T21:13:21.301Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A music player for the browser. Artwork-led interface, search across several catalogs, synchronized lyrics with word-level timing, a queue and local favorites. No account needed."],"features":["Search. Songs and albums come from iTunes, artists from Deezer, videos and playlists from YouTube. The top result follows the intent of the query.","Lyrics. Several providers are queried at once (BetterLyrics, LyricsPlus, LRCLib, KuGou, NetEase and others). Real word timing is preferred, then line timing, then plain text. Timing is never generated. You can shift it…","Playback. Online tracks play through the YouTube IFrame player. Local audio files play directly in the browser at their real format (for example FLAC 24-bit/96 kHz) and are never uploaded.","DJ mode. Beat-aligned transitions with tempo matching between songs, pitch preserved. Details in docs/DJ-TRANSITION.md.","Local by default. Favorites, history and recommendations stay in local storage. The app installs as a PWA and caches its shell; catalog, YouTube and lyric reque